  "project_scope_full": "The client needs an online portal for the parents of students of the client's school to communicate with their child's educators. The portal should have a login for the parents and a login for the educators. The parents should be able to see their child's educators and the educators should be able to see their students. The portal should have a chat feature for the parents and educators to communicate. The portal should have a calendar feature for the parents and educators to schedule appointments. The portal should have a file sharing feature for the parents and educators to share files."
